# What `quarto use template ssus-lab/ssus_papers@<tag>` leaves out of a
# paper's folder. Quarto already skips dotfiles, README.md, and _extensions/
# (installed separately). Patterns must be bare: a rooted pattern
# (/python/) matches nothing in .quartoignore (Quarto 1.11.9).
#
# the Python package, which a project installs with pixi
python/
# the blind specimen kept in the repo
blind.pdf
# render byproducts, present only when the source is a local checkout
*.otf
*.ttf
ssus-mark-light.pdf
index.*
template.pdf
template.tex
template.html
title-page.pdf
title-page.tex
*_files/
submission/
# the blind compile directory, left only by a failed render
_blind/
